{
  "rationale": "The plant automaton G1 models the robot's combined perception and motion capabilities, with states reflecting the local obstacle configuration and helper states for action commitment and recovery. The specification automata E1-E4 enforce safe and efficient exploration: E1 binds clear to move_forward, E2 binds obs_front to full_rotate recovery, E3 binds obs_left to rotate_clockwise, and E4 binds obs_right to rotate_counterclockwise. Each specification ensures only one controllable is enabled per state, and all uncontrollables are total. No forbidden controllable is enabled in obstacle states.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate plant automaton for robot's perception-action cycle, including helper states for action commitment and recovery.",
    "One specification automaton per sensor-action binding, enforcing deterministic, safe, and efficient exploration with exactly one controllable enabled per non-terminal state."
